#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:5 00e9b42aa7c04cfe8e81adc84cd89fbe
msgid "Calibration: Radio Calibration"
msgstr "校准：遥控器校准"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:7 240948f7ad354b5b98dd907b74e9ece3
msgid ""
"This article explains how to calibrate your autopilot to work with your RC "
"transmitter and receiver. See :ref:`Autopilot calibration <autopilot-"
"calibration>` for other calibration tasks."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何校准飞控以配合您的 RC 遥控器和接收机使用。有关其他校准任务，请参阅 :ref:`飞控校准 <autopilot-"
"calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:12 bb1d32769a9c425b94a34cacd49eb237
msgid "1 Prerequisites"
msgstr "1 前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:14 a72a2255be9641fbb83097546c948e9f
msgid "Before preforming setup, ensure that:"
msgstr "在执行设置之前，请确保："

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:16 6500d603379c4557be2448cdc88c4ce1
msgid "The vehicle is completely built to flight condition."
msgstr "飞行器已完整组装至可飞行状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:17 1074f69698b448148a921bf1b4dee609
msgid ":ref:`Firmware has been loaded onto the autopilot. <install-firmware>`"
msgstr ":ref:`固件已加载到飞控中。 <install-firmware>`"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:18 3970d9ec92034440b98cf644f2f4ac28
msgid ""
":ref:`Autopilot is connected to APM Planner and connected to Mavlink. "
"<connect-autopilot>`"
msgstr ":ref:`飞控已连接至 APM Planner 并连接至 MAVLink。 <connect-autopilot>`"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:19 7646651c99d145078f9dc07c68405106
msgid "RC transmitter and receiver are bound and powered."
msgstr "RC 遥控器和接收机已对频并上电。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:20 8e35049dd4d24742b487e8c9a2088789
msgid "Propellers are removed."
msgstr "螺旋桨已拆除。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:23 f49d6f7581814cf3b46acdcf10214d64
msgid "2 Prepare transmitter"
msgstr "2 准备遥控器"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:25 9d8adf50d92440acb289badab956a412
msgid ""
"Turn on the transmitter, and verify that it is in **airplane mode** (APM "
"needs airplane mode regardless of the platform type being piloted) and all "
"trims are centered."
msgstr "打开遥控器，确认其处于**飞机模式**（无论飞行平台类型如何，APM 均需使用飞机模式），且所有微调居中。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:29 2e71784e7b794e7fb60b4ae6d28d7e9e
msgid ""
"For Mode 1 transmitters, the left stick will control pitch and yaw, the "
"right stick will control throttle and roll. For Mode 2 transmitters, the "
"left stick will control throttle and yaw; the right stick will control pitch"
" and roll. For either type of transmitter, the transmitter’s three-position "
"switch should be attached to channel 5 and will control flight modes."
msgstr ""
"对于 Mode 1 遥控器，左摇杆控制俯仰和偏航，右摇杆控制油门和横滚。对于 Mode 2 "
"遥控器，左摇杆控制油门和偏航，右摇杆控制俯仰和横滚。对于任意类型的遥控器，遥控器上的三段开关应连接到通道 5，用于控制飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:37 136c15543b474958ac1c1fab5151c867
msgid "3 Calibrate"
msgstr "3 校准"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:39 e2fd895ec2e949e281f042ad625deaba
msgid ""
"Select Radio Calibration to teach your autopilot to work with your RC "
"transmitter and receiver. Select **Start Calibration** to begin. Read the "
"instructions in the following prompt and select **OK**."
msgstr ""
"选择「Radio Calibration」，让飞控学习您的 RC 遥控器和接收机的特性。选择「Start "
"Calibration」开始。阅读接下来弹窗中的说明并选择「OK」。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:46 d7be259e2cd94008a8a3c073c3e2ae7c
msgid "APM Planner2: Radio CalibrationScreen"
msgstr "APM Planner 2：遥控器校准界面"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:48 4c385784a70b442993f95138f7f90989
msgid ""
"Select Start Calibration to begin. Move both sticks in the largest circle "
"possible so that they reach their complete range of motion. Move the Ch 5 "
"and 6 toggle switches through their range of positions."
msgstr ""
"选择「Start Calibration」开始。将两个摇杆尽可能画出最大圆圈，使其达到完整的运动范围。将 Ch 5 和 6 拨动开关拨至各个位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:52 85b889733e2e412ca656783e2bcdd89d
msgid "Your transmitter should cause the following control changes:"
msgstr "遥控器操作应产生以下控制变化："

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:54 7fac013964a04e729d0fd69e1722c8fb
msgid "Channel 1: low = roll left, high = roll right."
msgstr "通道 1：低 = 向左横滚，高 = 向右横滚。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:56 964ff95757f3469c91ac39d39389f734
msgid "Channel 2: low = pitch forward, high=pitch back."
msgstr "通道 2：低 = 向前俯仰，高 = 向后俯仰。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:58 d72acc4f876441d398ed7106c5913bae
msgid "Channel 3: low = throttle down (off), high = throttle up."
msgstr "通道 3：低 = 油门收（关闭），高 = 油门推。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:60 399b39fb8565420ebf0359202509cd67
msgid "Channel 4: low = yaw left, high = yaw right."
msgstr "通道 4：低 = 向左偏航，高 = 向右偏航。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:62 deb4fe7fcdb44982a2512ce01a0fe13b
msgid ""
"Watch the red bars on the screen to ensure that the correct controls "
"activate for each stick movement. If the red bars move in the opposite "
"direction that you're moving the sticks, you will need to reverse the "
"channel on your transmitter. Select **End Calibration** when complete. "
"Resulting normal values are around 1100 for minimums and 1900 for maximums."
msgstr ""
"观察屏幕上的红色条，确认每个摇杆动作对应正确的控制响应。如果红色条的移动方向与摇杆移动方向相反，则需要在遥控器上反转该通道。完成后选择「End "
"Calibration」。正常结果值：最小值约为 1100，最大值约为 1900。"
